# 1. THE AUTHOR LIST. The entry below is the named author, confirmed by the
#    project owner. A Zenodo DOI is permanent and public, and it cannot be
#    quietly reassigned later — being named on it is a public, citable
#    attribution, so anyone added later must agree to be named.
#
# 2. THE DOI. Zenodo mints it on the first upload. Put the CONCEPT DOI here (the
#    one covering all versions), not the version DOI: the concept DOI always
